---
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CitationCard from '../../components/CitationCard.astro';
---
<article class="page-panel citation-page">
  <PageHeader class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Cantigny First Division Oral History Program</p>
    <h1>Walter Mendygral Oral History - Side B</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      This continuation includes Walter Mendygral's account of his World War II service
      and discussion of Mendygral family history. Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk) conducted the
      interview, with Josephine Mendygral also participating.
    </p>
  </PageHeader>

  <section class="citation-summary audio-summary">
    <img
      class="oral-history-player-image"
      src="/media/walter-mendygral-army-1200x900.webp"
      alt="Walter Mendygral wearing military flight gear beside an aircraft"
      width="1200"
      height="900"
    />
    <audio class="oral-history-audio" controls preload="metadata">
      <source src="https://media.carriegabaree.com/oral-histories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-b.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
      Your browser does not support the audio player.
    </audio>
    <p class="oral-history-links audio-link">
      <a href="https://media.carriegabaree.com/oral-histories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-b.mp3">Download or open the MP3</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="citation-summary">
    <p class="publication-meta">Identifier: CORHC-0006 · Side B · Runtime: 41:31</p>
    <p>
      <strong>Interviewee:</strong> Walter Mendygral<br />
      <strong>Interviewer:</strong> Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)<br />
      <strong>Additional participant:</strong> Josephine Mendygral<br />
      <strong>Format:</strong> Streaming audio (MP3)<br />
      <strong>Language:</strong> English
    </p>
  </section>

  <CitationCard class="citation-card">
    <div class="citation-card-header"><h2>Transcript</h2></div>
    <p>A speaker-identified transcript is available for research, accessibility, and reference.</p>
    <div class="button-group">
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-b-transcript">Read transcript online</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-b-transcript.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download transcript (PDF)</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/portfolio/citations/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-b-citation">Cite oral history</a>
    </div>
  </CitationCard>

  <aside class="citation-note">
    <h2>Access note</h2>
    <p>
      This is Side B of the interview. <a href="/portfolio/oralhistories/CORHC-0006-walter-mendygral-side-a">Listen to Side A</a>.
      The archive may later provide a combined streaming edition of both sides.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <aside class="citation-note">
    <h2>Transcript note</h2>
    <p>
      The transcript was generated using automated speech recognition and received a
      machine-assisted editorial review. Bracketed unclear passages require human review.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <div class="button-group citation-actions oral-history-back">
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="/oral-histories">Back to oral histories</a>
  </div>

  <p class="citation-disclaimer">
    This oral-history recording and transcript are provided for research, education,
    and public-history access. The audio recording remains the primary source.
  </p>
</article>
